usage: plan.py start [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --actor ACTOR
                     [--registrar PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT]] [--session SESSION]
                     [--grant GATE] [--scout | --no-scout] [--json]
                     plan item [item ...]

start (or resume) items of one detailed phase

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  item

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --actor ACTOR         PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT] running the items
  --registrar PROVIDER/MODEL[/EFFORT]
                        who registers the start when it is not the executor
                        (event registered_by)
  --session SESSION     provider session id, or auto
  --grant GATE          record an owner gate grant now
  --scout, --no-scout   ask the provider's weak model for a context map
                        (default: plan.settings.scout)
  --json
